      "side": 1,
      "message": "I understand the reasoning for this change and don\u0027t necessarily disagree with it. However, I think there are a bunch of objects that we want to think about how/if they should be ccached globally. Right now I think these are pretty light weight objects and we aren\u0027t extensively using multiple recordings. So I would prefer to hold of this change until later when we make a larger scale pass of trying to figure out what should be in a global cache vs per recording (balancing performance of dealing with thread safety and creating extra resources). I don\u0027t want to start this one object at a time where we end up with N slightly different caches/solutions for each object.",
